/-- **Advance 10.** Exact residual boundary after the polar audit.  Every small reduced equality now
has equal positive radius and is represented by one Euclidean redundancy element fixing the listed
vertex.  Consequently no radial, apex, seam, or polar-coordinate ambiguity remains.  The sole
