/-! ## 412. Complete actual closed-cycle kernel and the native seam quotient map

The actual finite-cycle kernel includes strict interiors, both endpoints, and zero radius.
It is exactly the relation generated by ordinary seams, the cyclic wrap seam, and apex
identifications. The actual map descends injectively and continuously to the native quotient.
The homeomorphism to its image explicitly requires the ambient Reduced space to be Hausdorff.
An open vertex neighbourhood, the concrete Hausdorff property, and the global periodicity
input are not asserted to follow from the abstract surface interfaces in this section.
-/

